     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.ValidateL3Functionality</b></p><a name=\"SGAuthoring.Skills.ValidateL3Functionality\"> </a><a name=\"hcSGAuthoring.Skills.ValidateL3Functionality\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>These requirements apply to the following actors: </p><ul><li><a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.QCReviewer.html\">Quality Control Reviewer</a></li><li><a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.FHIRModeller.html\">FHIR Modeller</a></li></ul><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"L3FUNC-01\"> </a></b>Test StructureMap extraction</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can execute StructureMaps against test QuestionnaireResponses and verify extracted resources match expected output.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"L3FUNC-02\"> </a></b>Test CQL execution</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can execute CQL libraries against test data and verify decision logic, scheduling logic, and indicator calculations.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"L3FUNC-03\"> </a></b>Test measure calculation</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can execute FHIR Measure evaluations and verify numerator/denominator calculations 