ations.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-L3FUNC-03\"> </a></b>Test measure calculation</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can execute FHIR Measure evaluations and verify numerator/denominator calculations against expected results.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-L3FUNC-04\"> </a></b>Verify L2 content coverage</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can manually verify that all L2 specifications are covered by corresponding L3 artifacts.</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><hr/><p><b>Arabic</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>السرد المُنشأ: Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.ValidateL3Functionality</b></p><a name=\"ar-SGAuthoring.Skills.ValidateL3Functionality\"> </a><a name=\"ar-hcSGAuthoring.Skills.ValidateL3Functionality\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">الملف الشخصي: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>تنطبق هذه المتطلبات على الجهات التالية </p><ul><li><a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.QCReviewer.html\">Quality Control Reviewer</a></li><li><a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.FHIRModeller.html\">FHIR Modeller</a></li></ul><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"ar-L3FUNC-01\"> </a></b>Test StructureMap extraction</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can execute StructureMaps against test QuestionnaireResponses and verify extracted resources match expected output.</p>\n</div></td><